Package: updoc
Title: Live Preview Server for 'pkgdown' Sites
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Leighton", "Payne",
      email = "leightonpayne98@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2305-6827")
    ),
    person("shadcn", role = "cph",
      comment = "Adapted preview interface patterns and design tokens"),
    person("Lucide Icons and Contributors", role = "cph",
      comment = "Preview icons"),
    person("Cole", "Bemis", role = "cph",
      comment = "Feather-derived preview icon")
  )
Description: Serves live previews of 'pkgdown' sites while you edit your
    package. Watches for saved changes, rebuilds affected pages, refreshes the
    browser, and displays build progress, warnings, and errors. Keeps the last
    working preview available if a build fails, and leaves generated files in
    your source package untouched while previewing.
